irect cmdliner.2.0.0 failures", "tree": {"sha": "aae7a531357fc22e1289d5e2eef14aa703e7a50e", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ocaml/opam-repository/git/trees/aae7a531357fc22e1289d5e2eef14aa703e7a50e"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ocaml/opam-repository/git/commits/4d3fb27660140304a970c6e7c1e9101286364ee4", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": false, "reason": "unsigned", "signature": null, "payload": null, "verified_at": null}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ocaml/opam-repository/commits/4d3fb27660140304a970c6e7c1e9101286364ee4", "html_url": "https://github.com/ocaml/opam-repository/commit/4d3fb27660140304a970c6e7c1e9101286364ee4", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ocaml/opam-repository/commits/4d3fb27660140304a970c6e7c1e9101286364ee4/comments", "author": {"login": "dbuenzli", "id": 485596, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NTU5Ng==", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/485596?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/dbuenzli", "html_url": "https://github.com/dbuenzli", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dbuenzli/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dbuenzli/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dbuenzli/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dbuenzli/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dbuenzli/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dbuenzli/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dbuenzli/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dbuenzli/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dbuenzli/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "committer": {"login": "dbuenzli", "id": 485596, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NTU5Ng==", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/485596?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/dbuenzli", "html_url": "https://github.com/dbuenzli", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dbuenzli/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dbuenzli/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dbuenzli/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dbuenzli/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dbuenzli/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dbuenzli/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dbuenzli/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dbuenzli/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dbuenzli/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "parents": [{"sha": "ec0dc125adb330b5f57fb9009c8dd112a5223366", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ocaml/opam-repository/commits/ec0dc125adb330b5f57fb9009c8dd112a5223366", "html_url": "https://github.com/ocaml/opam-repository/commit/ec0dc125adb330b5f57fb9009c8dd112a5223366"}]}, {"sha": "ef5b35a5ba5f4eaccd180f83afa56bea28a59341", "node_id": "C_kwDOAETL7doAKGVmNWIzNWE1YmE1ZjRlYWNjZDE4MGY4M2FmYTU2YmVhMjhhNTkzNDE", "commit": {"author": {"name": "Fr\u00e9d\u00e9ric Blanqui", "email": "frederic.blanqui@inria.fr", "date": "2025-07-16T11:57:26Z"}, "committer": {"name": "Fr\u00e9d\u00e9ric Blanqui", "email": "frederic.blanqui@inria.fr", "date": "2025-07-16T11:57:26Z"}, "message": "[new release] lambdapi (3.0.0)\n\nCHANGES:\n\n### Added\n\n- Tactic `simplify rule off` to simplify the focused goal wrt \u03b2-reduction only.\n- Tacticals `orelse` and `repeat`.\n- Tactic `eval` which evaluates a term and interprets it as a tactic. This allows one to define tactics using rewriting.\n- Builtin `\"String\"` for string literals between double quotes.\n- Options `--header` and `--url` for the `websearch` command.\n- In search queries, replace the substring `\"forall\"` and `\"->\"` by `\"\u03a0\"` and `\"\u2192\"` respectively.\n- Websearch queries and responses are now recorded in the log.\n- Commands `debug` and `flag` with no argument to get the list of debug flags and the list of flags respectively.\n- Tactic `change`.\n- Modifier `private` for `open` command to not be exported.\n\n### Changed\n\n- Replaced Bindlib by de Bruijn (Fr\u00e9d\u00e9ric) and closures (Bruno). The performances are slightly better than with Bindlib, especially on rewriting intensive files (the new version is 3.7 times faster on `tests/OK/perf_rw_engine.lp`). Lambdapi is now 2 times faster than dkcheck on matita, and only 2 times slower than dkcheck on holide.\n- Several improvements to use the search engine:\n  * normalize queries in websearch/search\n  * pre-load a file in websearch (e.g. to declare implicit args)\n  * paginate the output in the generated webpage\n  * allow to declare rewriting rules (e.g. alignments) over defined and constant symbols\n  * improve error message for overloaded symbols\n- Tactic set x \u2254 t: replace all subterms equal to t by x.\n- Enhance the formatting of the search results.\n- `require` and `open` are now recursive.\n\n### Fixed\n\n- Notations on external symbols are now exported.\n- Make the websearch server listen on all the interfaces instead of localhost only.", "tree": {"sha": "d5da781500f0b874af71653218b6899e1926a24d", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ocaml/opam-repository/git/trees/d5da781500f0b874af71653218b6899e1926a24d"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ocaml/opam-repository/git/commits/ef5b35a5ba5f4eaccd180f83afa56bea28a59341", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": false, "reason": "unsigned", "signature": null, "payload": null, "verified_at": null}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ocaml/opam-repository/commits/ef5b35a5ba5f4eaccd180f83afa56bea28a59341", "html_url": "https://github.com/ocaml/opam-repository/commit/ef5b35a5ba5f4eaccd180f83afa56bea28a59341", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ocaml/opam-repository/commits/ef5b35a5ba5f4eac